{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8fe63723a4f50c9c","name":"Drop Net","source":{"id":"source:reference-8fe63723a4f50c9c","title":"Drop Net","revision":21560,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:02:02Z","sha256":"bd4087df6a883342d37e21413304e1051ebea9ea6e63275ddc3c15f458d3f948","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21560","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Drop%20Net&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8fe63723a4f50c9c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Star Wars Miniatures Previews"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Star_Wars_Miniatures_Previews"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Drop Net makes an attack roll against all targets in a 2x2-square area within 12 squares. If the attack roll exceeds a target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},", that target takes 6d10 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," damage. Additionally, the Drop Net functions like a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Net"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Net","referenceId":"reference:660fb2c41d028988"},", allowing its user to attempt a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," against all targets successfully attacked by the Drop Net. Make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," check opposed by all such targets.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
